# EmCP app auth tokens (static MCP Bearer + optional operator Bearer).
# Active line:   <token> # <label>
# Disable line:  # <token> # <label>
#
# Copy to data/auth_tokens (gitignored) and chmod 600.
# Reload is automatic when the file mtime changes — no restart required.
#
# MCP / API:  Authorization: Bearer <token>
# Operator UI also accepts Bearer; username/password Basic Auth uses data/auth_users.
# Claude OAuth-issued tokens in data/_oauth/ keep working independently.

replace-me-with-a-long-random-token # default-operator
# old-revoked-token # revoked-example
